      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Case Detail Panel",
      "id": "case-detail",
      "intro": "Panel detail (Drawer Shell) yang muncul saat Anda mengklik baris Case di tabel. Panel ini menyajikan ringkasan informasi Case (Case Summary) dan daftar persentase klasifikasi alert di dalamnya (Data In This Case).",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Case Summary (Ringkasan Case)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Case ID & Description**: Menampilkan ID Case dan deskripsinya.\n• **Status Badges**: Indikator status (misal: `OPEN`), jumlah alert terkumpul, dan `Risk Score`.\n• **Stat Cards**: Dua kartu statistik utama untuk nilai **Risk Score** dan **Total Alert**.\n• **Detail Fields**: Menampilkan **Clustering Key**, **Created Date**, **Top Classification**, dan **Assigned To**.\n• **Top Classification**: Menunjukkan klasifikasi paling banyak dalam Case (misal: POSITIVE atau NEGATIVE).",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8fbff 0%,#edf5ff 100%);border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #dbeafe;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(59,130,246,.05);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;\">Case Summary</div><div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:900;color:#0f172a;margin-top:4px;\">#CAS-99120</div></div><div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:10px;background:#fee2e2;color:#dc2626;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z\"/></svg></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef9c3;color:#a16207;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">OPEN</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#e0e7ff;color:#4338ca;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">12 grouped alerts</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid #fecaca;color:#dc2626;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">risk 85</span></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;\">Risk Score</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:900;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">85</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Case risk value</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;\">Total Alert</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:900;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">12</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Alerts in grouping</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Data In This Case (Klasifikasi Breakdown)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Menampilkan rangkuman breakdown dari klasifikasi alert yang ada di dalam case ini.\n• Setiap baris menampilkan nama klasifikasi (contoh: **POSITIVE**, **SUSPICIOUS**), jumlah alert, dan progress bar (persentase).\n• Terdapat tombol **View Alerts** di setiap klasifikasi untuk langsung navigasi ke halaman `Alert Acquirer` yang telah di-filter sesuai case dan klasifikasi tersebut.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#d1fae5",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.02);\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;text-transform:uppercase;\">Data In This Case</div><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#e0e7ff;color:#4338ca;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">12 alerts</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;color:#dc2626;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">POSITIVE</span><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">8</span><div style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef2f2;color:#dc2626;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"/></svg> View Alerts</div></div></div><div style=\"height:6px;background:#f1f5f9;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"height:100%;width:66%;background:#dc2626;border-radius:3px;\"></div></div></div><div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef9c3;color:#a16207;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">SUSPICIOUS</span><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">4</span><div style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef9c3;color:#a16207;font-size:9px;font-weight:6